Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: Moonlight Folia bridges + NeoForge interaction +
 FluidType

- ServerPlayer adjustSpawnLocation + soft basePos (ServerPlayerMixin)
- reloadResources lambda$29 + CloseableResourceManager LVT (MinecraftServerMixin)
- PlaceCommand StructureStart local at TAIL (PlaceStructureCommandMixin)
- TeleportCommand keep Entity.teleportTo for WrapOperation
- Fluid.getFluidType via CommonHooks.getVanillaFluidType (Moonlight SoftFluid)
- Port CommonHooks interaction / break / EntityInteractSpecific hooks

